msgid "# Decode Context Parallel Guide"
msgstr "# 解码上下文并行指南"

msgid ""
"Decode Context Parallel (DCP) shards the KV cache along the sequence "
"dimension across devices in a Tensor Parallel (TP) group. It removes "
"redundant KV-cache copies and can increase the batch size available for "
"long-context decoding."
msgstr ""
"解码上下文并行（DCP）将KV缓存沿序列维度在张量并行（TP）组内的设备间进行分片。它消除了冗余的KV缓存副本，并可增加长上下文解码时可用的批处理大小。"

msgid ""
"Prefill Context Parallel is not supported by vLLM Ascend. The upstream "
"`prefill_context_parallel_size` option must remain at its default value of "
"`1`."
msgstr ""
"vLLM Ascend 不支持预填充上下文并行。上游的 `prefill_context_parallel_size` 选项必须保持其默认值 `1`。"

msgid ""
"DSA-CP is a separate sparse-attention optimization controlled by "
"`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp`. See [Additional "
"Configuration](../configuration/additional_config.md) for its configuration "
"and model requirements."
msgstr ""
"DSA-CP 是一个独立的稀疏注意力优化，由 `additional_config.enable_dsa_cp` "
"控制。有关其配置和模型要求，请参阅[附加配置](../configuration/additional_config.md)。"

msgid ""
"DCP supports eager and graph execution, prefix caching, chunked prefill, "
"speculative decoding, P/D disaggregation, and MLAPO on the model and "
"hardware combinations documented by vLLM Ascend. The SFA attention backend "
"supports speculative decoding. In the MLA and GQA attention backend, "
"speculative decoding is supported in the P/D disaggregation deployment "
"scenario and not supported in the mixed deployment scenario."
msgstr ""
"DCP 支持 vLLM Ascend 文档记录的模型和硬件组合上的即时执行和图执行、前缀缓存、分块预填充、推测解码、P/D 分离以及 MLAPO。SFA"
" 注意力后端支持推测解码。在 MLA 和 GQA 注意力后端中，推测解码在 P/D 分离部署场景下受支持，在混合部署场景下不受支持。"

